{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 160,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the people from the Hunger Games came to me\nand they asked me if I wanted to do an experiment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3880,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would be related to power generation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6200,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And strangely, there is this one idea\nthat I've been thinking about for years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9500,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now finally I have the chance to do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12320,
    "dDurationMs": 1460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Come check it out!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14380,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Positions...Here we go...Set...Yeah...Dolly...Lights! and... Action!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20320,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We have a setup here with two rain\nshower heads, making two strings of water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26040,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now each stream is gonna pass through a set of coils\n- right up by where they're released -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31520,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then it passes through this wire mesh down below."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34480,
    "dDurationMs": 4920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now these two sets of coils... So this set of coils\nis separate from this set of coils."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39400,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're each connected to one of these bowls here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42600,
    "dDurationMs": 6640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once we get the water flowing, we should be able to generate a little electric spark right here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49240,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There it is...!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50280,
    "dDurationMs": 6620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What's incredible is that we're generating a spark,\nwhich is probably five to ten thousand volts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56900,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would give you a decent little shock.\nI mean it's not actually dangerous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60300,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because, although the voltage is high,\nthere is not that much charge behind it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64060,
    "dDurationMs": 3980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can't get that much current flowing.\nAnd current is what does really does damage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68040,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now the question is: 'how, just out of this setup\nwhere we have falling water and some pieces of metal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73720,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do we generate ten thousand volts?!'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76380,
    "dDurationMs": 4340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well the way it works is that ...\nnormally water is perfectly neutral;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80720,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's even numbers of positive ions and negative ions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83600,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, as the water comes down of these two shower heads, sometimes there's gonna be a slight imbalance;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88360,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "maybe a little more negative in this stream\nand a little more positive in that stream."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92460,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now normally that just kind of washes out over time..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94960,
    "dDurationMs": 4280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But not in this case...!  Here's the ingenious part..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99240,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The mesh on the left is\nconnected to the ring on the right..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103560,
    "dDurationMs": 6060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, if this mesh becomes\nnegatively charged, then so does this ring..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109620,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now that ring will attract\nthe positively-charged water."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114000,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this whole stream becomes positively charged."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117500,
    "dDurationMs": 4540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, when it lands on this mesh,\nthis mesh becomes positively charged aswell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122040,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which means this coil over here is positively charged,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125800,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "forcing the negative ions to\nbe coming out of this stream more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129620,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, what we have is a clear separation of charge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133060,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a positively-charged stream on the right,\nand a negatively-charged stream on the left."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138340,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look closely at the streams,\nwhat you can actually see is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141940,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they get more and more attracted to these top coils."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145760,
    "dDurationMs": 4260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then the spark goes... and they reset."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153840,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So basically, what's happening is\nwe're building up charge on these coils"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157480,
    "dDurationMs": 5360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then, when the charge gets big enough, it jumps across from the negative side to the positive side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162840,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and everything becomes neutral again,\nand the charging process can start afresh."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166980,
    "dDurationMs": 4780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a pretty phenomenal piece of physics.\nI mean, it's such a basic setup ..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 171760,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and yet it produces this very impressive result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175180,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was noticed over a hundred of years ago\nby a guy named Lord Kelvin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178640,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's often called or 'Kelvin's Water Dropper',\nor 'Lord Kelvin's Rainstorm'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183340,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a really impressive phenomenon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185020,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you might be wondering\n'how much energy could I really get out of this system?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189080,
    "dDurationMs": 6880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, to put this in perspective, if you were to charge\nyour phone on the energy generated by this setup,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195960,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it would take six and a half years to reach full charge..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199880,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this is a very tiny amount of energy\ngeneration that we're talking about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204500,
    "dDurationMs": 4360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know, an interesting thing to consider is\n'where does this electrical energy come from?'"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208860,
    "dDurationMs": 4120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All we really have is just falling water and metal pipes..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212980,
    "dDurationMs": 4420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want you to leave me your answer in the\ncomments below, or make me a video response."
    } ]
  } ]
}
